It is now ten o'clock at night.
I get ready to go home.
I take my bag.
I look at Priya and smile.
"Priya, the food was very tasty," I say.
"Thank you so much for the dinner."
Priya smiles and says, "I am very happy."
"I think that you liked the food," she says.
I say, "Yes, I like it a lot."
"Next time you will come to my flat," I tell her.
"Then I will make Mexican food."
Priya says happily, "Oh, wonderful!"
"I will definitely come."
"We will eat Mexican food together."
"Let's plan it soon," I say.
Priya opens the door for me.
"Good night, we will meet at the office on Monday," she says.
I step outside and walk towards the metro station.
I think to myself that I now have good friends in Mumbai.
